<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Commonwealth of Nations</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Commonwealth of Nations is a voluntary association of independent states, most of them former territories of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/british-empire">British Empire</a>. It evolved from the self-governing <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dominion">dominions</a> of the empire in the first half of the twentieth century. It provided a framework for continued cooperation after <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/decolonisation">decolonisation</a> and is also mentioned in connection with former colonies of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italian-empire">Italian Empire</a> that later passed through British administration.</p></div>
